\item Build candidate anchors (e.g., with \code{\link[=make_anchor_table]{make_anchor_table()}}).
\item Run \code{review_mfrm_anchors(...)}.
\item Resolve issues, then fit with \code{\link[=fit_mfrm]{fit_mfrm()}}.
}
}

